            <td data-th="Class" style="text-align:center;">transferases</td>
            <td class="mt-column-width-30" data-th="Type of Reaction Catalyzed" style="text-align:center;">transfer reactions of groups, such as methyl, amino, and acetyl</td>
            <td class="mt-column-width-55" data-th="Examples" style="text-align:center;">Transaminases catalyze the transfer of amino group, and kinases catalyze the transfer of a phosphate group.</td>
        </tr>
